  "title": "Kelem dolmasi",
  "slug": "kelem-dolmasi",
  "summary": "Kelem dolmasi is an Azerbaijani dish consisting of cabbage leaves stuffed with a mixture of minced lamb, rice, chickpeas, and aromatic spices, then steamed in a tomato-based sauce.",
